## Test result

`uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"` →
**4923 passed, 299 skipped, 5 deselected** in 23.5s. No failures.

The evidence that the Databricks preset is unchanged is that
`tests/units/agents/test_agent_engine_base.py` and
`tests/units/core/test_sql_wizard.py` pass **without being edited**.

`uv run --frozen python tests/eval/run_engine_base.py` → `url_exact 27/27`,
`auth_header_exact 27/27`, `payload_shape 27/27`, `no_secret_leak 27/27`,
`live_smoke not run`, **aggregate 0.9000** against a 0.90 threshold. MLflow run
logged to the local file store (`experiment=1`); a workspace run URI needs the
interactive login above.

Negative control on the new guard: re-injecting the API key into a log line makes
`no_secret_leak` fail on 13 rows; reverting makes it pass. A guard that has not
been seen to fail is not a guard.

ruff: **4705 before, 4705 after** — zero new violations, including zero new
F-rule (real-bug) findings, which stayed at 67. Two `from back.core.helpers import
get_databricks_host_and_token` imports orphaned by the `_require_llm` extraction
were removed by line number; the pre-existing violations in the same files were
left alone.
